}

*Command: CmdStartJob

{

    *Order: JOB_SETUP.1

    *Cmd : "<1B>%%-12345X@PJL<0A>@PJL JOB NAME=<22>Lenovo print job<22><0A>"

}

*Command: CmdStartDoc

{

    *Order: DOC_SETUP.14

